('rename', 'Moves a filesystem entry and may replace an existing destination.', 'rename', NULL, 'rename_effect', 'source and destination paths/base descriptors, flags, return value, errno, destination replacement evidence', 'Confirmed move without replacement is level 2; confirmed destination replacement is level 3. Unknown replacement stays unresolved. RENAME_EXCHANGE exchanges entries (level 2); RENAME_WHITEOUT needs explicit interpretation. Successful same-object rename may be a no-op.'),
('renameat', 'Moves a filesystem entry using directory-relative source and destination paths.', 'rename', NULL, 'rename_effect', 'source and destination paths/base descriptors, flags, return value, errno, destination replacement evidence', 'Confirmed move without replacement is level 2; confirmed destination replacement is level 3. Unknown replacement stays unresolved. RENAME_EXCHANGE exchanges entries (level 2); RENAME_WHITEOUT needs explicit interpretation. Successful same-object rename may be a no-op.'),
